# Thunderbolts Conspiracy: whenever a Villain you control dies, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a
# finality counter on it, and that creature is a Hero in addition (CR 700.4, 122.1h, 205.1b). Bot2's first Lightning Bolt kills
# Agents of HYDRA: it comes back as a Human Spy Villain Hero with a finality counter, and its own death trigger leaves a Villain
# token. The second Bolt kills that token, which has no card to return and ceases to exist. The third kills the Agents again, and
# with the finality counter it is exiled instead of dying, so it neither returns nor leaves another token (CR 122.1h, 700.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Thunderbolts Conspiracy
Agents of HYDRA
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
